<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Z2 w/ Surges</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Target 45g carbs/hr. Practice this prescription.

MAIN SET:
• Steady 2.5-3h Z2 (60-70% FTP), with a 10sec seated burst every 20min (6-10x total)

EXECUTION:
• Simple day, burst is texture on top of a steady ride.

RPE guide: 65% FTP -> RPE 3</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <IntervalsT Repeat="8" OnDuration="1190" OnPower="0.65" OffDuration="10" OffPower="1.75"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.65"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>